ext-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q19GAZL41F54Ry0Pzib3rANOoiaV89picbSzhcd6tCkVOWvN5157ahN83uFUiaXbZXoIWaqR560z6zBA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          Doña Eira Estate 是\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          现在的庄园主劳拉·苏亚雷兹用母亲的名字艾拉来给庄园做的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          命名。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采摘成熟的咖啡鲜果，去除浮果。然后将咖啡鲜果放入真空密封的谷物袋中发酵3天后放置在庄园仓库里静置一段时间，温度控制在14-19摄氏度之间，最后在非洲晒床上干燥23天。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-sp